20px] text-[clamp(2.8rem,5vw,5.3rem)] leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.065em] text-[#f4f6fb]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-1-1-2\" id=\"features-heading\">\n                        Everything you need.\n                        <br data-kid=\"2-4-3-1-1-2-1\"/>\n                        <span class=\"text-[#8b93a7]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-1-1-2-2\">\n                            Nothing you don’t.\n                        </span>\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"max-w-[300px] text-sm leading-6 text-[#8b93a7]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-1-2\">\n                    Most editors start with a timeline. Talking Head starts with what you actually said.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2\">\n                <article class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#2e3444] bg-[#1a1d26] p-5 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#3b82f6]/60 lg:col-span-2\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1\">\n                    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -right-20 -top-24 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-[#3b82f6]/10 blur-3xl\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-1\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-2\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-2-1\">\n                            <div class=\"mb-4 inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-[#3b82f6]/15 text-[#7da4ff]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-hand-move text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-2-1-1-1\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;color:#7da4ff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <h3 class=\"font-satoshi text-xl text-[#e8eaef]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-2-1-2\">\n                                Drag & drop edits\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 max-w-[360px] text-sm leading-6 text-[#8b93a7]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-2-1-3\">\n                                Drop a zoom, sound, B-roll clip, VFX or text overlay right between the words. No hunting through tracks.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"hidden rounded-sm border border-[#3b82f6]/35 bg-[#3b82f6]/10 px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[9px] text-[#86aaff] sm:inline-flex\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-2-2\">\n                            DROP ZONE ACTIVE\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative mt-8 grid gap-3 rounded-sm border border-[#2e3444] bg-[#161922] p-4 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_190px]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-3\">\n                        <div class=\"rounded-sm border border-[#2e3444] bg-[#12141a] p-4\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-3-1\">\n                            <p class=\"mb-3 font-mono text-[9px] tracking-[0.14em] text-[#687188]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-3-1-1\">\n                                TRANSCRIPT / 00:18\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"text-[15px] leading-8 text-[#a9afbd]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-3-1-2\">\n                                The fastest way to\n                                <span class=\"rounded-[3px] bg-[#3b82f6]/20 px-1.5 py-1 text-[#b3c6ff] ring-1 ring-inset ring-[#3b82f6]/50\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-3-1-2-1\">\n                                    make\n                                </span>\n                                a point is to make it\n                                <span class=\"rounded-[3px] bg-[#2dd4bf]/15 px-1.5 py-1 text-[#72e9da] ring-1 ring-inset ring-[#2dd4bf]/45\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-3-1-2-2\">\n                                    clear\n                                </span>\n                                .\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"mt-5 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#2e3444]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-3-1-3\">\n                                <div class=\"h-1 w-[46%] rounded-full bg-[#3b82f6]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"feature section transcript progress\" data-reason=\"width updated to represent transcript playback\">\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap content-start gap-2 sm:pt-5\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-3-2\">\n                            <span class=\"h-fit rounded-[3px] border border-[#3b82f6]/50 bg-[#3b82f6]/15 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#86aaff]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-3-2-1\">\n                                Zoom · 1.2×\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"h-fit translate-x-2 rounded-[3px] border border-[#2dd4bf]/50 bg-[#2dd4bf]/10 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#6ee7d8]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-3-2-2\">\n                                SFX · click\n                            </span>\n                            <div class=\"mt-2 w-full border-t border-dashed border-[#3b82f6]/45 pt-2 font-mono text-[9px] text-[#7da4ff]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-3-2-3\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-left text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-1-3-2-3-1\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;color:#7da4ff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                                drag onto a word\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                <article class=\"group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#2e3444] bg-[#1a1d26] p-5 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#fb7185]/60\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-2\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-4 inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-[#fb7185]/15 text-[#ff9aae]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-2-1\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-typography text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-2-1-1\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;color:#ff9aae;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"font-satoshi text-xl text-[#e8eaef]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-2-2\">\n                        Edit by words\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#8b93a7]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-2-3\">\n                        Select a word, not a tiny slice of timeline. Your edit always knows what it belongs to.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-8 rounded-sm border border-[#2e3444] bg-[#161922] p-3\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-2-4\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[9px] text-[#687188]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-2-4-1\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-2-4-1-1\">\n                                SELECTED WORD\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#ff9aae]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-2-4-1-2\">\n                                00:22.4\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[11px] leading-6 text-[#8b93a7]\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-2-4-2\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-2-4-2-1\">\n                                keep\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"rounded-[3px] bg-[#fb7185] px-1.5 text-white\" data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-2-4-2-2\">\n                                this\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"2-4-3-2-2-4-2-3\">\n                                part\n                            </span>\n     